UnX Music 2.6.29 (version code 92)

- Preserve Quick picks when authenticated home refreshes omit the shelf.
- Rework Home genres into a full-width two-column grid and present weekly podcasts as readable ranked rows.
- Remove remaining SimpMusic Chart promo banners and use UnX Charts naming.
- Improve login navigation and Android system bar rendering.
- Add a local diagnostics console with crash and playback ticket capture, GitHub issue sync, and on-demand AI ticket analysis using the existing configured AI provider/key.
- Fix an Android startup dependency error by providing the GitHub sync repository its own Ktor HTTP client.
- Add Room migration 28 to 29 and diagnostic fingerprint / AI response parser tests.
- Fix Android Auto playback when the selected item exists in the temporary search results but not yet in the local song database.

This release does not claim that all upstream reports are resolved. GitHub issues include desktop-only reports, feature requests, stale-version reports, and problems dependent on external services/devices.
